exports[`project execution rejects silently omitted social channels and accepts justified exclusions 1`] = `
"Call collectors before planning to inspect actual acquisition capabilities. Every project must declare collection_requirements for official, paper, conference, youtube, x, feed and local, each as required, optional or excluded with a question-specific rationale. Do not silently omit YouTube or X, and do not collect irrelevant social content just to fill a quota. For YouTube discover exact video URLs and choose timed transcripts, slides or frames explicitly. For X distinguish public_post single samples from latest_posts authorized account windows; missing API credentials do not imply public samples are unavailable. Call collector-preflight with plan before run, and collector-probe with runId and data.source_id to diagnose a concrete source. A capability listing or probe is not successful acquisition. Preserve access failures and seek relevant alternative sources without claiming missing channels were covered."
`;
